error[naming]: `silly?` asks a question: a `?` function answers true or false (err may ride along) (module a_none_in_a_list_does_not_silence_the_rest)
error[none]: a list cannot hold a none: a lookup answers "not found" with one, so an element would be indistinguishable (module a_none_in_a_list_does_not_silence_the_rest)
